  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agbara Olouwa SARL | Cashew Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AGBARA markets fruit juices (cashew apple, pineapple, baobab, ginger, mango, tamarind, watermelon, fruit cocktail, fruit syrups, etc.), cashew kernels, cashew puree, cashew spirits improved gari and pre-cooked rice couscous with vegetables (carrots, shallots, celery, moringa, mustard and red pepper, etc.). .As for cashew apple juice, the market potential is very high not only at the national level but in the sub-region.</narrative>
  </description>
